WEBVTT

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.980
This sword is amazing!

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:19.810
Eris, you know you can leave
some of them to me, right?

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.600
You say something?!

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.020
I always dreamed of...

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.850
...living like this!

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:49.100
I want to eat beef.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:52.190
I want rice and beef!

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:01.560
There it is.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.810
--Wow!
--Oh!

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:17.480
Beyond those cliffs is the city of Rikarisu.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.150
Demons!

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.480
Wow.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.940
What's up?

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.440
Security's awful tight today.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:39.200
We got a report that Dead End's been sighted.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.200
Know anything?

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.490
Dead End?

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.450
S-Seriously?

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.960
Sorry, I don't know anything.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.650
Look! Look! Rudeus!

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.650
There are so many weird people!

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:56.230
The demons here look nothing
like the Migurd or Superd.

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:59.190
There are many tribes of demons.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:02.190
Anyway, what's "Dead End"?

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.400
Me.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.600
Excuse me?

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.850
I believe I'm called that in some places.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.400
So, Ruijerd equals "if you meet him, you die"?

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.440
What a dangerous nickname.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.270
What should we do?!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.440
Hmm...

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.310
Don't worry.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.400
I can leap over those cliffs.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.230
H-H-Hang on!

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.770
If you do that, the whole city will panic!

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:28.400
What should we do, then?!

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.270
Hmm...

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:41.650
I've got it.

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:43.980
Let's make a plan.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.100
Hi there!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.900
We came from the Migurd village.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.980
Okay. Go ahead.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:58.190
Right. Next!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:03.230
<i>You must not forget</i>

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:09.480
<i>On the earth the sound of thunder crawls</i>

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.520
Wow!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:15.190
<i>The dozing star also wakes</i>

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:21.520
<i>And fires like a rain of arrows</i>

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:28.600
<i>Let's pray for the return of the giver of breath</i>

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:35.060
<i>On dark nights beyond number</i>

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:40.690
<i>This song signals when they return</i>

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:47.850
<i>I'll never stop offering it to you</i>

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:54.440
<i>Even the scant tears in my withered view</i>

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.690
Ta-da!

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:54.850
It looks good on you.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:04:04.480
<i>I'll leave, leave until the day you wish</i>

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:58.560
Thanks, Rudeus! I'll take good care of it!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.980
Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.400
I believe there's an
Adventurers' Guild in this city.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.770
Adventurers?! Can we join?! Let's do it!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.190
We'll have to earn money from now on, after all.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.600
All right, let's head to the Adventurers' Guild!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.480
Yeah!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.100
Hurry up, Ruijerd!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.440
We'll stick to the plan.

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.150
R-Right.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.520
Get him! Go!

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.190
What was that, you bastard?!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.900
You wanna piece of me?!

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.350
Go on, give it to 'im!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.050
Comin' through!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.270
And... there!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.350
What? Are you lot <i>really</i> adventurers?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:01.730
Y'all look like a sorry bunch to me!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.610
Who the hell are you?

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.830
Don't chicken out when you get a look at my bro.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.710
Yes! He's the devil of the Superd tribe!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.880
The great "Dead End" Ruijerd!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.600
What're you so quiet for?!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.980
You gonna turn tail and run?!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.990
Hey! What's so funny?!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.070
Don't you know?

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:53.410
The Superd have <i>green</i> hair.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:11.480
Do you really want to name
your party "Dead End"?

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.980
Yes, please.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.430
Hear that? Dead End's a newbie!

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.100
Everyone starts at F rank.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:26.270
Remember, you can only accept jobs
up to one rank above your own.

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:28.810
Okay.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.940
Now I'm an adventurer, too, right?!

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.480
Hurry up, Rudeus!

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:41.770
I can't read them!

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:45.350
I'd like to get right to making money, but...

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.940
Slaying jobs start at C rank.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:52.180
We can't take them right now. That's a shame.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:55.140
Hey there, "Dead End."

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.180
Ain't the rank on this a wee bit high for you?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.190
I already know that!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:04.980
Hey now, don't be mad.
I just wanna give you some advice.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:10.200
Here, how about this one? Finding a lost cat.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.570
Your bro's Dead End the Superd, right?

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:18.370
I bet he can find a lost kitty
in no time with his third eye.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.120
Shove it!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:24.000
Let's get going, bro!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:56.370
See you later, newbies!

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.520
Rudeus! Why didn't you take any jobs?!

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:07.520
I want to go slay a dragon already!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.810
Now, now. Maybe someday.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:12.230
For now, let's celebrate our success.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.400
Was that success?

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:19.270
We introduced you as Dead End,
and no one was afraid. They laughed.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:21.690
That's progress.

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.560
Leave it to me.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.850
We're pretending you're a Migurd now,

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.690
but if we keep doing good deeds,

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:32.600
it should improve the Superd's reputation.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.940
Don't lose that, all right?

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:38.650
It's a precious gift from my master.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.810
Right.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:42.020
Wow!

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:56.100
Amazing! I've never seen anything like it!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.400
Let's rest for today.

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:00.690
Starting tomorrow, we'll be busy.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.310
I suppose so.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:11.190
I'd like to book a room for three.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.030
Hey, you're a new adventurer, right?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.200
So are we. How about you eat with us?

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.160
Don't ignore me!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.940
Don't touch me!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:26.770
Look...

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.730
...what you did!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.050
Huh? What?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.940
This is the first...

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:40.980
...piece of clothing... Rudeus ever bought me!

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.480
Calm down, Eris! That's enough! Heel!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.520
Sorry.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.400
She doesn't speak Demon-God.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.440
I-I didn't know.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:57.570
Still, I'm amazed you can use healing magic.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.910
You should both join our party.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:02.580
You must be nervous on your own.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.290
I'm sorry,

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.790
but we're a party of three.

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:10.580
Huh? That guy's with you?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.800
Yes. His name's Ruijerd.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:16.220
Ruijerd? What's your party name?

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.090
Dead End.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:22.930
What?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.310
You sure about that name?

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:28.350
We have his permission.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.730
Excuse me?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.810
Anyway, what does it matter?

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.070
That's how it is, so we can't join you.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.650
Really? Too bad.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.700
I hope you don't regret it. We're gonna be huge.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.450
Bachiro!

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.700
Gablin!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.910
Kurt!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:48.960
Together, we're the Tokurabu Toughs!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:53.210
Someday, we'll make this pose world famous!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.100
Hmm.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:53.940
Something about this
makes me feel itchy deep inside.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.730
I'll mend that for you tomorrow.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.350
Really?!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.310
What will we do now?

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:13.100
What we need most is money.

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:15.850
This inn costs five stone pieces a night each.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:18.770
E- and F-rank jobs will leave us in the red.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:22.480
Add in food and miscellaneous expenses, and...

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:28.020
I spent my past life as a bum.
I never expected to worry about money.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:38.650
Again?

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:40.600
What is it this time?

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:45.980
You took my advice to rely on Ruijerd,
and it got you to a city, right?

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:46.940
Hah!

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:52.520
Ruijerd would have guarded us from
the shadows even if we'd run away.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.440
Sounds like you trust him a lot.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.100
So, why won't you have some faith in me?

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:02.350
You're a god, and you don't know?

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:04.770
Now,

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:07.230
more importantly, my next tip.

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:09.770
Yeah, yeah. Make it quick.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.560
You're no fun!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:16.270
I hate the feeling of this body.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.690
So, just get this over with.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.850
How obsequious.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:23.560
You've got me in the palm of your hand anyway.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:26.230
Oh, no, not at all.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:28.940
What you do is <i>your</i> choice.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:30.850
Enough chit-chat. Hurry up.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.310
Fine, fine.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.940
Ahem.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:39.310
Rudeus, accept that job to find a lost kitten.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:43.940
Do that, and your worries will be at an end.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.310
Finding lost kittens can't pay much.

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:56.650
What's he thinking?

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.350
You can't sleep?

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:05.850
Yeah.

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.400
Hey, Rudeus.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:12.850
Yes?

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.400
Will we make it home?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.480
We'll make it.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:26.850
And Ghislaine and
Grandfather will be fine, right?

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.520
I'm sure they will be.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:42.730
Here, kitty!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.810
Kitty!

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:52.100
Are you sure this is the right way?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.100
Yes, I'm sure.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.520
With your third eye?

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.940
Yes.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.560
Look. There are signs of a struggle here.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:09.020
I don't see anything.

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.850
This way.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.810
Here.

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:19.020
Ugh!

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:22.020
This place stinks like animals!

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.650
How many people?

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.270
No people, but many living creatures.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:30.310
Sounds like we'd better be careful.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.560
What is this place?

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:49.270
It's here.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:52.270
What? That's no kitten.

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:56.230
I guess everything's bigger
on the Demon Continent.

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:59.400
Are the others someone's pets too?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:01.690
Someone's coming.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.940
Huh?

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:08.590
I'm sick of working in this
pit every day. Ain't you?

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.180
Think of an easier way to make a living.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:15.430
F-Fine. I'll think of something.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.850
Shut up!

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:26.150
Don't get too cocky unless you wanna die.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.500
The hell's going on?!

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.150
Thank God they're so weak.

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:47.150
We fought kind of like a team just now, huh?!

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.020
Yes, we did.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.260
Who the hell are you?!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.220
I'll kill you!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:01.270
I have some questions for you.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.440
If you--

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:10.240
Don't get cocky, brat!

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.900
Damn it, that hurt.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.320
Calm down, Lohman!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:17.440
He really is stupid. Doesn't he know
what could happen if he makes us angry?

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.370
W-We're on the level! Just hear us out.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.440
What are you--?

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.190
Huh?

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.850
Huh?

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:45.850
Why did you kill him?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.520
Because he hurt a child.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.850
Y-You shouldn't kill.

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:55.730
Why not? He was evil.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:59.980
"Wh-Why not"? That should be...

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:06.940
There's a reason you shouldn't kill people.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.270
What?

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:13.810
I-If you kill people, it will make
the Superd's reputation even worse.

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:15.980
Even if they're evil?

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:20.270
It doesn't matter who you kill,
just who killed them.

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.440
I don't understand.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.850
Look! You made trouble for Rudeus!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.650
How? I know I did the right thing.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.310
That attitude is why people don't like you!

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:40.020
Anyway,

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.310
please don't kill anymore.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:45.980
At all. Not if you value
the Superd's reputation.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.690
I don't want to be afraid of you, Ruijerd.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.510
D-Did you say "Superd"?

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:00.510
Are you a <i>real</i> Superd?!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.350
What if he is?

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:05.560
P-Please! Just don't kill me!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.850
Tell me what these pets are doing here.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.730
We kidnapped them!

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.530
And then what?

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:18.910
When someone posts a lost-pet job,
we pretend to find it for the reward!

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:20.310
I see.

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:21.850
Villains. I knew it.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.600
W-Wait a minute!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.270
What should we do?

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:31.400
Think. Think.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.340
You were making money on lost-pet jobs.
So, you're adventurers?

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.880
Th-That's right.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.480
What's your party rank?

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.800
D. Why?

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.350
Can you go up a rank?

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.350
Wh-Why do you want to--?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.560
Answer the question!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.270
W-We can!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:53.730
We stayed at D rank on purpose
so we can take lost pet jobs!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.100
I thought so.

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:03.530
All right, then. Team up with us
and we'll spare your lives.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:05.370
Huh?

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:10.940
Why would we work with these villains?

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.810
I have a good idea.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:14.810
Ruijerd, could you please keep quiet?

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:15.900
What?

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:19.150
If we work with them,
we can earn money efficiently

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.690
while also improving the Superd's reputation.

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.900
Don't be absurd!

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:27.060
I refuse to depend on villains such as these!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.940
Let go of him!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.600
What's your problem?!

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.060
I don't like villains.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.270
Why do you complain all the time?!

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:41.480
He's doing all this for me and you!

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:44.600
What's so bad about
kidnapping a few animals, anyway?!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:47.730
They also kicked a child.

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:51.060
I kick people, too!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.770
But evil is evil.

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:56.730
Didn't you do bad things a long time ago?!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.690
Rudeus is amazing!

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:01.810
Leave it to him, and everything will work out!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:04.350
If you're going to complain, leave!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:07.980
Rudeus and I can manage on our own!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:16.060
Eris, please don't say anymore.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.770
I'm a Superd warrior.

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:21.400
I never go back on my resolutions.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:25.020
I will see you home no matter what.

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.850
Right.

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:41.850
Our day's earnings!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:47.180
I-I raised our party rank to C like you said.

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:51.100
Then take a B-rank slaying job tomorrow.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.640
We'll take an F-rank job.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.560
What are you planning?

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:00.070
Don't tell me we're going to trade jobs?

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.990
Any problems?

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:02.990
N-No.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:07.070
When you finish a job,
spread the name "Dead End."

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.830
Spread it? Everyone already knows it.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.710
Make it sound good. Say how well-behaved we are.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:17.460
I don't care if it's true; just advertise.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.000
You know what happens
if you double-cross us, right?

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:23.260
W-We know.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:26.180
What's this?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:30.810
It's Dead End! What are you doing with P Hunter?

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.430
N-Nokopara.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:36.020
What happened to Lohman? Wasn't he with you?

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.900
Lohman is... dead.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:42.610
I see. Sorry to hear that.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.450
And he was the strongest of you.

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:49.070
By the way, what were y'all talking about?

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:56.370
Oh, I get it. Acting big for the newbies.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:57.670
S-Something like that.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:01.250
I guess newbies are about the
only people you could impress.

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:04.300
Well, best of luck to y'all!

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.970
Episode 10

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.970
The Value of a Life and the First Job

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:46.990
